    "grumble": {
      "word": "GRUMBLE",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "To murmur or mutter with discontent; to make ill-natured complaints in a low voice and a surly manner. L'Avare, not using half his store, Still grumbles that he has no more. Prior.",
