          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "To rumble; to make a low, harsh, and heavy sound; to mutter; as, the distant thunder grumbles.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "To express or utter with grumbling.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "The noise of one that grumbles.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "A grumbling, discontented disposition. A bad case of grumble. Mrs. H. H. Jacksn.",
